{"seconds": 64.1, "exit": 0, "final": "Excellent! So the line is:\n1. **Bxh7+ Kxh7**\n2. **Ng5+ Kg8** (best try; other moves lose faster)\n3. **Nxf7 Qxf2#**\n\nThis is a classic smothered mate pattern combined with a deflection. The key move is **Bxh7+**, which forces the king into a mating net.\n\n**Coaching note:**\n\nYour bishop sacrifice **Bxh7+** forces the king into the open. After **Kxh7 Ng5+ Kg8**, White plays **Nxf7**, and Black's own pieces (pawns on g7, h7) trap the king\u2014any recapture on f2 is checkmate. Look for sacrifices that expose the enemy king, especially when your pieces can chase it into corners.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Bxh7+\", \"line\": [\"Bxh7+\", \"Kxh7\", \"Ng5+\", \"Kg8\", \"Nxf7\", \"Qxf2#\"], \"motifs\": [\"sacrifice\", \"discoveredAttack\", \"backRankMate\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "r1b1r1k1/pp1p1ppp/4pq2/2b1n3/2P5/2PB1N2/P4PPP/1RBQ1K1R w - - 1 13"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "r1b1r1k1/pp1p1ppp/4pq2/2b1n3/2P5/2PB1N2/P4PPP/1RBQ1K1R w - - 1 13"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "r1b1r1k1/pp1p1ppp/4pq2/2b1n3/2P5/2PB1N2/P4PPP/1RBQ1K1R w - - 1 13"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r1b1r1k1/pp1p1ppp/4pq2/2b1n3/2P5/2PB1N2/P4PPP/1RBQ1K1R w - - 1 13", "move": "Bxh7+"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r1b1r1k1/pp1p1ppB/4pq2/2b1n3/2P5/2P2N2/P4PPP/1RBQ1K1R b - - 0 13", "move": "Kxh7"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r1b1r3/pp1p1ppk/4pq2/2b1n3/2P5/2P2N2/P4PPP/1RBQ1K1R w - - 0 14", "move": "Ng5+"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r1b1r3/pp1p1ppk/4pq2/2b1n1N1/2P5/2P5/P4PPP/1RBQ1K1R b - - 1 14", "move": "Kh8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r1b1r2k/pp1p1pp1/4pq2/2b1n1N1/2P5/2P5/P4PPP/1RBQ1K1R w - - 2 15", "move": "Nxf7+"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r1b1r2k/pp1p1Np1/4pq2/2b